{"question": "If you observe low nDCG scores in the output of your retrieval system, what specific symptoms might lead to this, what causes could you investigate, and what fixes would you suggest?", "topic": "RAG", "subtopic": "retrieval evaluation", "difficulty": "intermediate", "skills": ["diagnostic analysis", "nDCG interpretation", "system optimization"], "expected_concepts": ["nDCG", "ranking issues", "relevance score distribution", "query refinement"], "follow_up_topics": ["addressing user feedback", "impact of document quality", "revising scoring algorithms"], "evaluation_criteria": ["Identifies ranking issues as a potential cause", "Mentions relevance score distribution in the analysis", "Suggests query refinement as a fix"], "id": "q_01c40ac83d", "source": "llm_generated", "review_status": "pending", "reference_answer": {"key_points": ["Low nDCG scores may indicate poor ranking of relevant documents, suggesting that the retrieval system is not effectively prioritizing high-relevance items.", "Investigate the relevance score distribution to identify if relevant documents are being scored too low or if irrelevant documents are being scored too high.", "Consider query refinement techniques such as expanding the query with synonyms or using more advanced natural language processing methods to improve retrieval accuracy.", "Evaluate the ranking algorithm parameters, such as the weight assigned to different features, to ensure they align with the relevance of the documents.", "Check for data quality issues, such as missing or incorrect relevance labels in the training set, which could skew the model's learning. "], "common_mistakes": ["Assuming low nDCG is solely due to algorithmic issues without considering data quality.", "Neglecting to analyze the distribution of relevance scores before jumping to conclusions about the ranking model.", "Overlooking the importance of query context and user intent in the retrieval process."]}, "follow_up_questions": ["What specific ranking algorithm are you using for your retrieval system?", "How do you currently evaluate the relevance of documents in your dataset?", "Have you considered implementing user feedback to refine your queries?"]}
